Nobody brings the bill until you ask for it 🧾
In most Spanish-speaking countries, rushing you out is considered rude.

Today's phrases:
• la cuenta, por favor = the check, please
• ¿efectivo o tarjeta? = cash or card?
• enseguida = right away

